# Use pnpm

This project uses **pnpm** exclusively. Never use `npm` or `yarn`.

- `pnpm install`, `pnpm add`, `pnpm remove` for dependency management
- `pnpm run <script>` or `pnpm <script>` for running scripts
- `pnpm exec` instead of `npx`

If any other rule or skill references `npm` commands, treat those as outdated — substitute `pnpm` instead.
